#: kram/ui/package_model.py:28
msgid "Installed by the user: autoremove keeps it"
msgstr "由用户安装：autoremove 会保留它"

#: kram/ui/package_model.py:29
msgid "Installed with a package group: autoremove keeps it"
msgstr "随软件包组安装：autoremove 会保留它"

#: kram/ui/package_model.py:30
msgid ""
"Installed outside dnf, or dnf lost the record: treated as installed by the "
"user,\n"
"so autoremove keeps it. Mark it as a dependency if something else pulled it "
"in."
msgstr ""
"在 dnf 之外安装，或 dnf 丢失了记录：视为由用户安装，\n"
"因此 autoremove 会保留它。如果它是被其他软件包带入的，请将其标记为依赖。"

#: kram/ui/package_model.py:32
msgid "Installed as a dependency: autoremove removes it once nothing needs it"
msgstr "作为依赖安装：不再被需要时 autoremove 会删除它"

#: kram/ui/package_model.py:33
msgid ""
"Installed as a weak dependency (recommended by another package):\n"
"autoremove removes it once nothing needs it"
msgstr ""
"作为弱依赖安装（由其他软件包推荐）：\n"
"不再被需要时 autoremove 会删除它"

